    </problem><solution>
    
    
  
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    
    <para>Your answers will vary.</para>
  
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End --></section>

<note class="self-check">
  (    <para>For the function \(g(x) = 5x^2 - 8x + 4\), find \(g(-3)\).</para>)
